EnvHarness (optional integration)
  https://github.com/google-research/envharness
  Copyright 2026 Google LLC / The EnvHarness Authors. Apache License 2.0.
  Proctor ships an *adapter* (python/proctor/integrations/envharness_adapter.py) that exposes Proctor
  environments through EnvHarness's ActionableEnv interface so EnvHarness layers (for example `Setup`)
  can wrap them. No EnvHarness source is copied into this repository, and Proctor does not reimplement
  EnvHarness's harness-search ("EnvRigger") idea. Install EnvHarness separately to use the adapter.

